Q.casilla_build_cd = Q.time;
Q.funds -= 2;
var gain = 4 + Math.floor((Q.sup_colonos + Q.sup_peasants + Q.sup_students) / 30);
Q.red_casillas += gain;
Q.fe_voto += 1;
Q.expediente += 1;
Q.political_capital += 1;
!}

Another few hundred tables covered, in a ledger kept in three copies and no filing cabinet. It is invisible work, it photographs badly, and it is precisely how an election stops being a coronation. On the night it matters, the distance between what happened and what the state announces will be exactly as wide as this list is long.

